{"unit_id":"unclecode__toolshrink#card-zh","repo":"unclecode/toolshrink","commit":"3d654ab491146dd685f0b47fef94e78a14590860","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"toolshrink 是一个面向 DeepSeek Harness 的工具输出精简插件，也可作为通用 TypeScript 库使用。它在工具结果交给模型前识别文本形状，并从测试输出、构建结果、diff、JSON、表格、日志、堆栈、目录树和重复行中保留关键信息；无法识别时按字符数和行数预算保留头尾或相关一端。输出会标记省略量；启用 spill 后，完整原文保存到可插拔存储，默认写入本地文件并附带 locator。适合希望减少 agent 上下文占用、同时保留失败信息和结果摘要的用户。无需 API key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/pipeline.ts:41-54","src/pipeline.ts:68-113","src/spill.ts:31-56","adapters/harness/toolshrink.mjs:38-68"]}
{"unit_id":"unclecode__toolshrink#card-en","repo":"unclecode/toolshrink","commit":"3d654ab491146dd685f0b47fef94e78a14590860","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"toolshrink reduces oversized tool output for DeepSeek Harness or as a TypeScript library. It summarizes common formats such as tests, diffs, and JSON, with omission markers and a size fallback. Optional local spill storage keeps the original. No API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/pipeline.ts:41-54","src/pipeline.ts:68-113","src/spill.ts:31-56","adapters/harness/toolshrink.mjs:38-68"]}
